        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          The first thing to know when deciding how to get to Khao Sok National Park is that there are a number of options. Despite its remoteness it is very easy to get here. And you can choose very economic options including local bus transport.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
